# Internal prep materials — not for the public repo.
# The deck/whitepaper is submitted as a PDF URL, the demo script and submission
# checklist are for the author only. None are referenced by the /docs site or by
# any committed doc (web/src/routes/Docs.tsx imports only the six product pages).
docs/DECK.md
docs/DEMO-SCRIPT.md
docs/SUBMISSION.md
docs/design-refs/

# Generated/runtime state — never hand-meaningful, regenerated on build or on
# the next process tick. web/public/receipts/* is copied at build time from
# the real receipts/ (below) by web/scripts/sync-assets.mjs; the source of
# truth stays tracked, the copy doesn't.
*.tsbuildinfo
worker/state.json
web/public/receipts/
